<title>USA: GA Financial repurchases up to 5 pct of shrs.</title>
<headline>GA Financial repurchases up to 5 pct of shrs.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>GA Financial Inc said Wednesday that it will repurchase up to 445,000 shares of its common stock, representing about 5 percent of its outstanding common shares.</p>
<p>The buybacks will be in the open market between now and March 26, 1997, the company said.</p>
</text>
